# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large-file policy
#
# Do not ignore useful binary formats here. The companion .gitattributes and
# push-to-github.sh route common model/data/Unreal/art assets and files above
# the configured threshold through Git LFS.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX (La Bibbia del Game Design)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.lof
*.lot
*.out
*.run.xml
